---
import ConverterPage from '../components/ConverterPage.astro';
---

<ConverterPage
  path="/bengali-font-converter"
  lede="Planned: a Bengali font converter for Bijoy and other legacy Bengali fonts to Unicode Bengali."
>
  <h2>Planned, not started</h2>
  <p>
    Bijoy is the legacy Bengali font most older documents were typed in, and the
    conversion problem is the same shape as the Hindi one: glyphs stored on ASCII
    codepoints, in visual rather than logical order.
  </p>
  <p>
    The script is not. Bengali has its own character set and a more elaborate
    conjunct system than Devanagari, so it needs its own map and its own test
    documents. The route is scaffolded so the work has somewhere to go; it will
    be switched on only after a keyword check and a tested mapping.
  </p>
</ConverterPage>
